WEBVTT

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:10.005
The FDE's here. Forward-deployed — the engineer literally lives here now.

00:00:16.021 --> 00:00:24.487
The cloud? That box over there is the cloud. Model, data, all of it — it has never left this room.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:37.055
Onboarding went fine. Except the stack got deployed forward first.

